  "uncertain": [
    "Image 3 shows Micro USB (+5V, USB D-, USB D+, USB ID, GND), USB A (+5V, USB D-, USB D+, GND) and RJ45 Ethernet (R5 TD+, R4 TD-, R1 RD+, R2 RD-) with individually labeled signals; these were not transcribed as wiring connectors because their physical pin positions are not shown."
  ],
  "notes": "Label = microcontroller port name (PC7, PF7...) where printed (rule 5 GPIO name); Arduino board names first in functions. D3/SCL and D2/SDA have no port name printed, so the board name is the label. Repeated ADC[n] tags recorded once. Overbars on some names (RESET port box, OC4D, OC4B, OC4A, RTS) are not represented. O/0 decided by context: OC0A, OC0B, OC4B with letter O. Typo SLECT copied as printed. Atheros AR9331 signal list, LEDs and buttons in image 3 are not header positions and were skipped."
}